 "text": "Hey, good to have you here. How are you? Cats learn quickly that keyboard makes a nice wall. You could block it with small box, or switch to using only one side of the room. Sorry, it' just that my car broke down again. It' been going in out of gear for weeks, and now the battery is dead. At top of a loud hill, traffic had stopped. It's okay. I just wish these little nags would stop. That' be lovely. I've been living on sandwiches since my other half went away. Thanks for stopping. At the top of the loud hill. The kids were yelling. She did used to love walking on the desk, and my boss found out who she was. We stopped after that.",
